      "notes": "Problems → banner in the panel",
      "notesInFlow": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lingo Feeder follow-ups + number health\nEvery 15 min: chats where Lingo spoke last and the customer went quiet become **Stopped replying**; each gets ONE follow-up with a 🛒 Order button, only inside WhatsApp's free 24 h window and between 08:00 and 21:00 Sri Lanka time (lingo_feeder.settings → timing).\nEvery 6 h: each number's token, status and quality rating.\nSame credentials and SUPABASE_URL as the main Lingo Feeder workflow.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 1000,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "78f07f19-95a5-4306-bcbd-4c6612ec38df",
